# Code owners — who reviews what.
#
# BOOTSTRAP_PLACEHOLDER: replace @owner with a real GitHub username or team during bootstrap.
# Preventive maintenance with no named owner is a calendar nobody reads.
#
# Later lines win, so the most specific rule for a path should come last.

# Default owner for everything.
*                       @owner

# Standards and durable agent configuration are invariant across projects built from this template.
# Changing them here rather than upstream is a decision worth a second pair of eyes.
/docs/standards/        @owner
/.agents/               @owner
/AGENTS.md              @owner

# Decisions are append-only; a superseding ADR should be reviewed, not merged quietly.
/docs/decisions/        @owner

# CI, supply chain, and the invariant checks.
/.github/               @owner
